## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates practical skills in cross-DC coordination, configuration management, and state synchronization using Docker Config and Redis Pub/Sub. It also covers rate limiting and error handling under load.

## Key Concepts
- Docker Config for storing per-tenant quota limits
- Redis PUB/SUB for cross-DC quota propagation
- Quota checks with eventual consistency across peers
- TLS edge routing with Traefik

## Code Example
```javascript
const quota = getQuota(tenantId);
if (quota <= 0) throw new Error('Quota exceeded');

await performImport(data);
decrementQuota(tenantId);
publishQuotaUpdate(tenantId, getQuota(tenantId));
```
